# Quality

## Before Finishing
- Run `bun run lint`.
- Run `bun run test`.
- Run `bun run build`.
- Make sure `/` still renders the dashboard.
- Keep the worktree clean when publishing changes.

## Code
- Use TypeScript without `any`.
- Prefer named exports.
- Keep changes scoped to the requested prototype.
- Remove unused prototype-specific screens, assets, and routes.
- Do not leave tokens, secrets, or private URLs in tracked files.

## Testing
- Do not build a full test suite for simple visual prototypes.
- Add focused tests only for reusable logic, parsers, state machines, or risky behavior.
